    "# Analysis Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook produces every statistic and figure reported in *\"AI Investment and National AI Capability: What AI Investment Does and Does Not Buy\"* (Rachita Mehta, August 2026).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Data sources:**\n",
    "- `data.xlsx` — AI venture capital investment by country and year, from the OECD AI Policy Observatory (Preqin data).\n",
    "- Stanford HAI Global AI Vibrancy Tool (2024) — pillar-le\n",
    "- vel ecosystem scores for the ten countries in Stanford's own 2024 top-10 overall ranking, recorded from the tool's per-country exports and entered below.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Structure:**\n",
    "1. Load and inspect the investment data\n",
    "2. Figure 1 — investment trend by country, 2012–2026\n",
    "3. Figure 2 — top 15 countries by 2024 investment\n",
    "4. Enter Stanford pillar-level data (10-country sample)\n",
    "5. Build the Non-Economic AI Ecosystem Score and the HHI concentration measure\n",
    "6. Figure 3 — investment vs. Ecosystem Score\n",
    "7. Figure 4 — investment vs. HHI (breadth)\n",
    "8. Figure 5 — ecosystem composition by country\n",
    "9. Spearman correlations (the paper's two headline results)\n",
    "10. Table 1 — full country-level summary table\n"
   ]
  },
