   "source": [
    "## 5. Derived measures: Non-Economic AI Ecosystem Score and HHI\n",
    "\n",
    "**Ecosystem Score** — equal-weighted average of the six Vibrancy pillars *excluding* Economy (Economy is 50% Total AI Private Investment + 50% Newly Funded AI Companies, so including it would make investment partly predict itself).\n",
    "\n",
    "**HHI (Herfindahl–Hirschman Index)** — a concentration measure from industrial-organization economics, applied here to each country's own distribution of capability across its six non-economic pillars. Low HHI = capability spread evenly across dimensions; high HHI = concentrated in one or two."
   ]
  },
